@HelpdeskApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5537

### Generate a token first via the Aspire dashboard resource commands (or `aspire resource apiservice jwt-customer`)
### and paste it below.
@token = paste-a-generated-token-here

### See the identity encoded in your token.
GET {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### List tickets. Requires tickets:read:own (your own org) or tickets:read:any (every org,
### staff role required). Customers only see their own org regardless of scope.
GET {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### With tickets:read:any (agent/admin), filter tickets to a specific company.
GET {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets?org=globex
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### File a new ticket. Requires tickets:write:own or tickets:write:any - the ticket is always
### filed under your own org either way.
POST {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Monitor flickering on startup",
  "body": "Started this morning. Happens a few times an hour, only on the left display."
}

###

### Add a comment to ticket 1. Requires tickets:write:own (only on your own org's tickets) or
### tickets:write:any (any org, staff role required).
POST {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Looking into this now."
}

###

### Assign ticket 1 (requires the tickets:assign scope and an agent/admin role).
POST {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedTo": "agent.sam"
}

###

### Close ticket 1. Admins need tickets:close:any (any ticket, any org). Customers need
### tickets:close:own (any ticket, but only within their own org). Agents can never close
### tickets, even if granted one of these scopes.
POST {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Hard-delete ticket 1 (admin role only).
DELETE {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### List companies (agent/admin role only).
GET {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add a company (admin role only).
POST {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "initech",
  "name": "Initech"
}

###

### Remove a company (admin role only).
DELETE {{HelpdeskApi_HostAddress}}/companies/initech
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
